cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "DEVISE: Data Exploration, Visualization, and Inference with Statistical Estimation"
authors:
  - family-names: "Wendorf"
    given-names: "Craig A."
    email: "cwendorf@uwsp.edu"
version: "0.260605"
license: "MIT"
repository-code: "https://github.com/cwendorf/DEVISE"
url: "https://github.com/cwendorf/DEVISE"
abstract: >-
  DEVISE is a companion package for working with other statistical packages.
  Where other packages provide high-accuracy confidence intervals for a wide
  variety of statistics, DEVISE handles the pre-processing of data and
  post-processing of results into more accessible and readable formats.
